findings.claim:
The 'keep an over-reporting regression visible' case is marked material, and so is the 'Mutation check of the Windows-folder Facts' contract. Their only check is a manual procedure: revert a hunk in a scratch copy, touch Scanner.cs and run. That is an uncommitted throwaway procedure owed by build, which CC-004 forbids for case obligations. Both outcomes it would establish are already measured:
- spike 3 runs d1-d3: correction reverted, the Fact fails 3/3, 'kept 7 of 7; 4 of 7 ... old';
- spike 1: the attempted-open rule gives tree (d) kept 0 vs truth 1.
